# One debit card in use per account. The cvv is not stored: it only appears when the card is issued.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/account/card
@customerToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_auth.http
@adminToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_auth.http
@cardId = 1

### Issue a card for my account, in the name of the token's "name" claim (CUSTOMER_BASIC)
### The only response with the full number and the cvv: keep them for purchases.
### 409 if the account already has an ACTIVE or BLOCKED card
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### My cards, with the number masked (CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Block: ACTIVE -> BLOCKED (owner CUSTOMER_BASIC or ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{cardId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Unblock: BLOCKED -> ACTIVE (owner CUSTOMER_BASIC or ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{cardId}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Cancel: final, allows issuing a new one (owner CUSTOMER_BASIC or ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{cardId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Block any customer's card (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{cardId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
